# Hand-derived expected index frame F-A5 (plan 06-01, D-02, D-18, D-19): cards with no image are background only.
# Derivation: docs/video/frame-derivations.md. Written from the card rules before any renderer exists; never produced by a run.
# Plane grammar: 96 rows after the line plane, each 20 groups of 8 symbols (0-9A-F) separated by one space; the 8th symbol of group 20
# is the cut-off pixel of the 7-pixel last column (clip side right) and is written -. The published plane is the 159 columns left of it.
frame F-A5
tier source-expectation
oracle independent-derivation
rules CR-05 CR-06 CR-08 CR-14
mode fgbg
display on
border 0
stack 0 0 0 0
fill 1600
cell 2 0 240B | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=1
cell 2 1 2413 | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=2
cell 2 2 2423 | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=4
cell 2 3 2443 | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=8
cell 2 4 2483 | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=16
cell 2 5 2503 | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=32
cell 2 6 25FB | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 grom card=63
cell 2 7 2C0B | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 gram card=1
cell 2 8 2DFB | fgbg fg=3 bg=6 gram card=63
